  "body": "Packet #1143 · `CI-DUONG-NHANH-BO-DOT-BIEN` r1. Approved spec SHA-256: `38e478eac8ea89f52db917c673fa9a17d583605acbd94ede62920e39a41a05ab`. Executor lease: `ci-duong-nhanh-bo-dot-bien-r1-g1-codex-20261102`. Original base: `279a39e34c26027ad792008962859aa79c16e35c`.\n\nCurrent candidate HEAD: `1039f0d71eec0c863a50a342a4753f9982768611`. The PR changes only `.github/workflows/ci.yml`, `ops/ci_duong_nhanh_test.py`, and `.claude/dev/chay-cong-windows.ps1` relative to current master. The fast lane still runs all 118 harness cases; it skips only the harness mutant audit when `CI_DUONG_NHANH_CHE_DO` is exactly `duong_nhanh`. The full lane runs all 431 mutants. The wrapper removes the new variable before its gate commands.\n\n### Verified at this HEAD\n\n- [Full PR CI run 41413466192](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/actions/runs/41413466192): `success`. `gate-ops` reported `CA: 118/118 dat` and `DOT BIEN: 431/431`.\n- [A6 pre-canary run 41414412379](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/actions/runs/41414412379) on [measurement PR #1156](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1156), whose base is this exact HEAD: `success`, 625 aggregate runner seconds (10m25s), required checks succeeded, fast-lane markers present, zero Windows jobs ran. Probe #1156 is measurement only and will not be merged.\n- `actionlint .github/workflows/ci.yml`, `ruff check --select F ops/ci_duong_nhanh_test.py`, and `python .claude/dev/ci_dang_ky_test.py`: passed locally at this HEAD.\n- Windows PowerShell 7 `chay-cong-windows_test.ps1` on `tra-luat-win`: original base and HEAD both returned 15/36, exit 1, because Git fails while constructing several mock repositories (`The empty string is not a valid path`). The `t30` missing-key set is identical and excludes `CI_DUONG_NHANH_CHE_DO`; `t32` differs only in the `gate-ops` fingerprint; all case colors match. This is a measured A8b delta, not a full Windows suite pass.\n\n### Remaining gates\n\n- [M9 full mutant audit run 41420415501](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/actions/runs/41420415501): `success` on this HEAD; every job succeeded.\n- Independent Antigravity review on this exact HEAD: P1/P2/P3 = `0/0/0`; [review receipt](https://github.com/ducthangho/tra-luat/pull/1155#issuecomment-6574367543). `kiem-merge` K0–K7 returned exit 0 (`ĐỦ ĐIỀU KIỆN MERGE`). Land evidence remains after merge.\n- Post-land A11 canary runs and ledger readback before declaring #1113/#1128 `landed`.\n\nPre-merge gates are complete on this exact HEAD. Post-land A11 and bookkeeping remain after merge.\n",
